    "updated_at": "2018-07-27T06:23:33Z",
    "body": "Referring to the scenarios where `input[type=\"year\"]` would be sound, I think years could be represented alongside with eras. For example, 1 BC would be counterintuitive to be represented as `0` for a `number` input, but technically 1BC is the year before 1AD. This is one such case; there could be other year representations in other calendars.\r\n\r\nEras could be added for ease of jumping across large spans of time as well.",
