    "body": "I find the \"input type=number\" a poor alternative because:\r\n- `valueAsDate` field can not be set and read on a number type input\r\n- `input[type=year]` CSS selector doesn't work - although using a special class be a workaround\r\n- there is no picker -  `datalist` could be a partial workaround; however, `datalist` doesn't have a notion of current date as other intervals pickers and has a different UI\r\n\r\nIt would be amazing to see the year next to the other interval types.",
